</li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Achievement Support: </strong>Unlock a variety of achievements as you master the game, adding extra layers of challenge and reward.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Short Rogue-like Deckbuilder! As a missionary, you\u2019re forced into a cardgame by a wicked man. He promises if you beat level 13, he'll set you free. Draw as many cards as you like, but if you pull the same color twice, all your cards burn! Obtain SPECIAL CARDS. Build Your Deck. Reach Level 13!",
